nted and tested.\n      - id: AC4\n        text: go vet ./cmd/version/ reports no issues.\n\nI should check if there's an existing test suite for cmd/version, and I'm also reconsidering what progName should be -- it's likely \"version\" since that's the command name, but I should verify this matches the project's naming convention for utilities.\n\nLet me refine the design decision to not prescribe the progName value, since that should come from the PRD. Now I'll compile the project analysis and task description.\n\nOne more thing to verify: the exact paths for the use case and test suite files. Based on the naming pattern I'm seeing, the test suite should be at docs/specs/test-suites/test-rel-00.0.yaml, though I'm not entirely certain these files exist yet since the spec_complete status suggests the specification is done.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":83480,"cache_read_input_tokens":19289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":83480},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d09866b-d50d-422f-9ae5-dd597496d61f","uuid":"227b09e3-25dd-40ad-a9a8-02e4f8d8179d"}
