blocked pending human spec authoring.\n\n```yaml\n- index: 0\n  title: \"Implement cmd/version per prd011-magefiles\"\n  dependency: -1\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/product-requirements/prd011-magefiles.yaml (PRD -- authoritative spec for cmd/version requirements and output format)\n      - docs/specs/use-cases/rel00.0-uc001-magefiles.yaml (use case covering cmd/version execution path)\n      - docs/ARCHITECTURE.yaml (DD7 confirms cmd/version is the only code generation target from prd011-magefiles)\n      - cmd/cat/main.go (reference for cmd/ package conventions -- progName, SIGPIPE handler, flag parsing, exit codes)\n      - cmd/wc/main.go (reference for cmd/ package conventions -- buffered output, error formatting)\n      - pkg/sys/signal.go (InstallSIGPIPEHandler used by all cmd/ packages)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/version/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: Version command implementation per prd011-magefiles\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: Read prd011-magefiles.yaml and implement all requirements that apply to cmd/version. Architecture DD7 confirms cmd/version is the only code generation target from this PRD. Implement exactly what the PRD specifies.\n      - id: R2\n        text: Follow cmd/ package conventions established in cmd/cat and cmd/wc -- package main, const progName, sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() as first call in main(), error messages to stderr formatted as progName colon space message, buffered stdout via bufio.Writer.\n      - id: R3\n        text: Print version information to stdout and exit 0 on success. The exact output content and format must match what prd011-magefiles specifies.\n      - id: R4\n        text: Handle all flags and exit codes specified in prd011-magefiles for cmd/version. Handle unrecognized flags with an error message to stderr and exit 1, following the pattern in cmd/cat parseArgs.\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Follow existing cmd/ patterns: package main, const progName, sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() as first statement in main(), manual flag parsing (no flag package), buffered stdout flushed before os.Exit.\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: prd011-magefiles.yaml is the single source of truth for cmd/version behavior. Implement exactly what the PRD specifies -- do not add features, flags, or output fields not in the PRD.\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: cmd/version/main.go exists and compiles with no errors (go build ./cmd/version/)\n      - id: AC2\n        text: All prd011-magefiles requirements applicable to cmd/version are implemented\n      - id: AC3\n        text: go vet ./cmd/version/ reports no issues\n      - id: AC4\n        text: Output format and content match prd011-magefiles specification exactly\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":83480,"cache_read_input_tokens":19289,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":83480},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d09866b-d50d-422f-9ae5-dd597496d61f","uuid":"cd8fa787-5664-45ed-ace9-66efd179fa93"}
